    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "foot_note",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 712,
      "width": 1150,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Two quality gates — Verify (5, “does it work?”) and Review (6, “is it well-made?”), orange-bordered. Commit is a cross-cutting rhythm, not a numbered step.\nThe Approval Checkpoint (red) locks the wave shape and ends interactive engagement; Steps 4–9 run unattended within stop-and-wake.\nIntent, rigor, and scale are independent dials set at Step 0 — rigor: audited adds a mandatory adversarial critic; incident-response floors at audited.",
      "originalText": "Two quality gates — Verify (5, “does it work?”) and Review (6, “is it well-made?”), orange-bordered. Commit is a cross-cutting rhythm, not a numbered step.\nThe Approval Checkpoint (red) locks the wave shape and ends interactive engagement; Steps 4–9 run unattended within stop-and-wake.\nIntent, rigor, and scale are independent dials set at Step 0 — rigor: audited adds a mandatory adversarial critic; incident-response floors at audited.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
